[Narrator]
{music 0-silence.ogg}You stir in bed restlessly. It's been what, ten, eleven hours now? 

You open your crust-laden eyes and are met with the pitch-blackness of your bedroom ceiling.

[Jet]
Mmmm...
Mmrgh.

[Narrator]
You are so, so tired of being tired all the time. You’re exhausted. Exhausted in a way that sleep cannot possibly hope to fix.

[Jet]
